@flexiarg process/built-but-not-wired-invisibility
@title T3: Built-but-not-wired Invisibility
@keywords trap, T3, unwired, inhabited-but-unconsumed, wiring, acceptance-authority
@audience checker authors, machine builders
@tone plain
@style pattern
@why war-room/wr-27-a-loop-is-born-instrumented-for-its-gain
@problem P-assured-process.md S1: the tick's closure boundary excludes the seven store-owning namespaces of the full-loop click path — the process surface has no stepper, no pin, no replay
@how consumption as a checked rung: the designated acceptance authority must be wired to every path it judges, and unwired machinery must be listed, not discovered

! conclusion: Machinery that is inhabited but unconsumed reads as present to binary accounting while doing nothing. A component is only real when something consumes it on the path it was built for; wire the acceptance authority to failure paths too, and inventory the unwired.

  + context: Acceptance checkers, reconciliation scripts, notification paths, services. Catalogued as T3 in N-process-trap-recording-conventions section 1.

  + IF:
    A component exists, elaborates or runs, and nothing on its intended path calls it.

  + HOWEVER:
    Binary accounting cannot represent inhabited-but-unconsumed, so it reads as present.
    + VIOLATION (WM): four confirmed instances, including the R14 dial and fixture-fed EIG. Receipt: futon2 holes EPIC-run-era.md, via N-process-trap-recording-conventions.md T3.
    + VIOLATION (APM): campaign_trace emit! and the Lean trace checker — the designated acceptance authority — wired only to the success path; frame_park_decisions/-main left unwired when the watcher's mutation path was correctly removed (futon3c aa139dce), caught only by cross-reading two individually-correct packets; process_watchdog/default-notify! shells out to notify-send, which is not installed on the host — a dead escalation path of unknown age; apm-axiom-audit.service runs beside the machine and was never a criterion inside it, which is what permitted T1's b00J02.

  + THEN:
    Treat consumption as a checked rung (the conventions note's rung grammar: constructed then wired, never skipping); wire the acceptance authority to failure paths as well as success; keep an inventory of unwired components so invisibility is a listed fact, not an archaeology result.

  + BECAUSE:
    Each instance is individually correct and the defect lives only in the wiring — no per-component test can catch it; only a rung that refuses on unconsumed machinery can.
    + evidence: N-process-trap-recording-conventions.md section 1, T3, six receipts ([WM] x1 naming four instances, [APM] x5, incl. futon3c aa139dce). Authority grounding: WR-27, a loop is born instrumented for its gain — machinery outside the loop it instruments has no gain and no reality.
